<slide>
  text-size: 4vmin
</slide>

<h2>Step 1: mix</h2>

<ol>
  <li>Stir flour and water until no dry flour is left</li>
</ol>

<step>
  <ol start=2 anim=left>
    <li>Rest for 30 minutes</li>
  </ol>
</step>

<step>
  <ol start=3 anim=left>
    <li>Add starter and salt, squeeze them in with wet hands</li>
  </ol>
</step>

<step>
  <p anim=pop><b>Do not knead.</b> The folds do the work.</p>
</step>
